title: Tour the agrupaciones
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: sp_exile
view-if: sanchez_leader = 0 and exiled = 0 and exile_tour_timer <= 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; exile_tour_timer = 2

= Tour the agrupaciones

No car from the party, no staff. You drive yourself from one local branch to the next, as you did in 2014.

- @tour_members: Listen to the members
- @tour_critic: Criticise the leadership's line

@tour_members
on-arrival: sanchismo += 5; member_morale += 2

The halls are small and full. The members tell you what they would not tell Ferraz.

@tour_critic
on-arrival: {! Q.sanchismo += 7; Q.populism += 1; Q.member_morale -= 2; if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.transferRaw(Q, 'psoe', {up: 0.5, cs: 0.5}, {students: 0.5, workers: 0.5}); } !}

"The PSOE has forgotten who it is for." The leadership calls it disloyalty; the members call it the truth.

@book
title: Write a book
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: sp_exile
view-if: sanchez_leader = 0 and exile_book_timer <= 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; exile_book_timer = 12

= Write a book

A publisher offers you an advance for your account of the last years. The working title is *Manual de resistencia*.

- @book_yes: Write it
- @root: Not now

@book_yes
on-arrival: sanchismo += 6; funds += 1; populism += 1

It sells well. Everyone in politics reads the chapter about themselves first.

@organise
title: Build the organisation
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: sp_exile
view-if: exiled = 1 and player_is_ps = 1 and exile_org_timer <= 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; exile_org_timer = 2

= Build the organisation

A new party needs branches in fifty-two provinces, candidates, lawyers and money.

- @org_branches: Open branches across Spain
- @org_defectors: Recruit PSOE mayors and councillors
- @org_movement: Run it as a movement: open primaries and online votes

@org_branches
subtitle: Costs 1 in party funds.
choose-if: funds >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Needs 1 in party funds.
on-arrival: {! Q.funds -= 1; if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.campaignRaw(Q, 'ps', {workers: 0.8, pensioners: 0.6, professionals: 0.6, unemployed: 0.6, students: 0.5, homemakers: 0.4, self_employed: 0.3}); } !}

[+ new_party_name +] now exists outside Madrid.

@org_defectors
on-arrival: {! Q.rel_psoe = (Q.rel_psoe || 15) - 6; if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.transferRaw(Q, 'psoe', 'ps', {pensioners: 1, workers: 1, homemakers: 0.6}); } !}

A dozen mayors in Andalusia and Extremadura switch sides. The PSOE's new leadership is furious.

@org_movement
on-arrival: {! Q.populism += 1; if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.campaignRaw(Q, 'ps', {students: 1.2, unemployed: 0.8, professionals: 0.5}); } !}

Young volunteers join by the thousand. The press calls it Podemos with a tie.

@bid
title: Bid for the leadership
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: sp_exile
view-if: exiled = 1 and player_leads = 0 and player_is_ps = 0 and exile_bid_timer <= 0 and elections_held >= 2
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; exile_bid_timer = 6

= Bid for the leadership

[+ my_party +] is not doing as well as it hoped. Some of its members think the newcomer with a national profile should lead it.

- @bid_go: Stand for the leadership
- @root: Not yet

@bid_go
on-arrival: {! Q.bid_won = (Q.sanchismo + Q.populism * 3 + (Math.random() * 20 - 10) >= 45) ? 1 : 0; if (Q.bid_won) { Q.player_leads = 1; } else { Q.sanchismo -= 5; } !}

[? if bid_won = 1 : The members choose you. Pedro Sánchez leads [+ my_party +], and would be its candidate for Prime Minister. ?][? if bid_won = 0 : The founders close ranks. The newcomer will have to wait. ?]

@bridge
title: Bridges to the PSOE
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: sp_exile
view-if: exiled = 1 and exile_bridge_timer <= 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; exile_bridge_timer = 3

= Bridges to the PSOE

Old colleagues still take your calls, some of them.

- @bridge_lunch: Lunch with old friends in the PSOE group
- @bridge_attack: Attack the PSOE leadership instead

@bridge_lunch
on-arrival: {! Q.rel_psoe = (Q.rel_psoe || 20) + 8; !}

The conversation is awkward and useful.

@bridge_attack
on-arrival: {! Q.rel_psoe = (Q.rel_psoe || 20) - 6; Q.populism += 1; if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.transferRaw(Q, 'psoe', Q.player_party, {workers: 0.6, students: 0.4}); } !}

Some PSOE voters agree with you. None of its leaders will.

@exile_funds
title: Raise money
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: sp_exile
view-if: exiled = 1 and exile_funds_timer <= 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; exile_funds_timer = 3

= Raise money

- @funds_small: Small donations from supporters
- @funds_big: A dinner with business donors

@funds_small
on-arrival: {! Q.funds += 0.6 + Q.sanchismo / 60; !}

Thousands of small transfers. Not much, but nobody owns you.

@funds_big
on-arrival: {! Q.funds += 2; Q.populism -= 1; !}

A generous evening. The photos are less generous.

@low_profile
title: Keep a low profile
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: sp_exile
view-if: sanchez_leader = 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1

= Keep a low profile

A quiet month: a few interviews declined, a few calls returned, a lot of reading.

- @low_watch: Watch and wait
- @low_calls: Keep in touch with your people

@low_watch
on-arrival: sanchismo -= 1

Out of sight is, a little, out of mind.

@low_calls
on-arrival: sanchismo += 2

Your network holds together.
